# BE Inference from Cloned FE

> Khi đã có FE clone xong (xem `clone-website.mdc` Phases 1-5), suy ra backend tương ứng.
> Updated với evidence-based pattern từ santowilem/skills (clone-ui).

## Anti-drift principle

Mọi endpoint/schema generated PHẢI có evidence trong captured source — không bịa routes. Nếu section content không capturable (third-party widget, gated) → render empty body ở FE, KHÔNG tự ý tạo fake endpoints cho nó.

## Workflow

### 1. Inventory FE dependencies

Đọc `clone/<domain>/components/` và `clone/<domain>/app/`:
- List TẤT CẢ `fetch()` / `apiClient.*` calls
- List TẤT CẢ form submits (with their field names + validation rules)
- List TẤT CẢ dynamic routes cần data
- List TẤT CẢ realtime features (WebSocket, polling, SSE)

Output: `.clone-ui/plan/api-inventory.md` — append to plan folder (không tách file mới)

```markdown
| Endpoint | Method | Used in | Auth | Query/Body | Response |
|----------|--------|---------|------|------------|----------|
| /posts   | GET    | FeedPage | yes | ?page&limit | {data, meta} |
| /posts   | POST   | NewPostForm | yes | CreatePostDTO | Post |
```

Cross-reference với `.clone-ui/source/embeds.json` — nếu có Senja widget thì KHÔNG tạo `/api/reviews` endpoint (data từ vendor).

### 2. Define entities

Từ inventory + visual inspection → ERD:

```
User {
  id, email, name, avatarUrl
  createdAt, updatedAt
}
Post {
  id, title, content, authorId
  published, createdAt
}
```

Add fields ONLY khi visible in UI hoặc inferred từ form fields. Không bịa `bio`, `phone`, `address` trừ khi có trong form/input.

### 3. Generate OpenAPI spec

Output: `.clone-ui/plan/openapi.yaml`

```yaml
openapi: 3.1.0
info:
  title: <domain> Clone API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /api/posts:
    get:
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/PostListResponse'
    post:
      security: [{ bearerAuth: [] }]
      requestBody:
        required: true
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/CreatePostDTO'
```

### 4. Generate Zod schemas

Output: `packages/shared/schemas/<domain>/`

```typescript
export const PostSchema = z.object({
  id: z.string().cuid2(),
  title: z.string().min(1).max(200),
  content: z.string(),
  published: z.boolean().default(false),
  authorId: z.string().cuid2(),
  createdAt: z.coerce.date(),
  updatedAt: z.coerce.date(),
});

export type Post = z.infer<typeof PostSchema>;

export const CreatePostSchema = PostSchema.pick({
  title: true,
  content: true,
  published: true,
});
export type CreatePostDTO = z.infer<typeof CreatePostSchema>;
```

**Conventions** (xem `create-shared-schema.md`):
- Schema names: `<Entity><Action>Schema`
- Use `.strict()` to reject unknown keys
- Custom error messages bằng tiếng Anh
- Reuse: `RegisterSchema = LoginSchema.extend({ name: z.string() })`

### 5. Implement routes (chỉ endpoints FE dùng)

Pattern (xem `controller-service-repo.mdc`):

```
apps/backend/src/modules/<domain>/
├── <entity>.controller.ts
├── <entity>.service.ts
├── <entity>.repository.ts
└── <entity>.validator.ts
```

**Quy tắc**:
- Implement ĐỦ endpoints FE gọi
- KHÔNG implement tính năng thừa (YAGNI)
- Reuse existing modules (auth, users, posts)
- Update OpenAPI spec sau khi code

### 6. Wire FE to BE

Trong `clone/<domain>/`:
- Thay mock data → real API calls
- Set `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` trong `.env.local`
- Test end-to-end với backend chạy local

Verify responses match Zod schemas (Phase B parity check):
- Same `evaluate_script` payload on FE request → BE response
- Compare field names, types, structure

## Anti-patterns

- ❌ Implement full CRUD khi FE chỉ cần GET + POST
- ❌ Skip validation — luôn có Zod schemas
- ❌ Skip OpenAPI spec — phải có spec để AI refactor sau
- ❌ Tự ý đổi response format (xem `api-state.mdc`)
- ❌ Hardcode user IDs — luôn từ auth context
- ❌ Tạo endpoints cho content từ 3rd-party embeds (Senja, Calendly...)
- ❌ Bịa fields không có trong form/input

## Open questions → ASK user

Khi gặp ambiguity (KHÔNG tự quyết):
- Cần auth/social login?
- Cần file upload?
- Cần realtime (Socket.io) hay polling?
- Cần payment integration?
- Cần email notifications?
- Cần admin panel?

## BE inference checklist

- [ ] `api-inventory.md` lists all FE calls
- [ ] ERD derived từ visible fields only
- [ ] `openapi.yaml` complete cho all endpoints
- [ ] Zod schemas ở `packages/shared/schemas/<domain>/`
- [ ] Routes implement đúng theo FE usage
- [ ] FE wired to real API (no mock data)
- [ ] Response parity check pass (Pass B)
- [ ] No endpoints cho 3rd-party embeds
- [ ] No invented fields
